<h1>Hardware Settings - Localiser (Faro Platinum Advanced Settings)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<h2 class="whs4">Advanced Settings in Localiser Tab</h2>
<p>When the FARO Platinum localiser is connected to the PC, click the 'Advanced Setting's button and the following window will appear:</p>
<p><img src="../images/plat_adv_1.jpg" width="423px" height="285px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<p class="sub-head">'Configuration' section</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Contains information about arm diagnostics and arm buttons functionality.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Diagnostics'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Loads the FARO diagnostics' window.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP173918866" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../images/plat_adv_2.jpg" width="443px" height="546px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> For full description of the window, please refer to the help file for FaroArmUSB.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Localiser buttons assignment' section</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Allows the user to change the correspondence between localiser buttons and remote control buttons. By default the 'Front-A Rear-B' radio button is enabled. That means the default correspondence of the localiser buttons is:</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Front arm' button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Duplicates functionality of the 'A' button of the remote control</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'</b></span>Back arm' button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Duplicates functionality of the 'B' button of the remote control</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">'Probe Calibration' section</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Displays information about the current probe and enables starting new probe calibration.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Enable scan mode during probe calibration<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'</b></span> checkbox</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Enables the feedback, so the captured points can be seen.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Select probe' button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Enables changing the current probe settings. Click on this button and the following dialogue will appear:</p>
<p><img src="../images/plat_adv_3.jpg" width="512px" height="454px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Hole Calibration'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Starts a new hole calibration procedure for the current probe.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Sphere Calibration'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Starts a new sphere calibration procedure for the current probe.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'View log'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Displays the calibration log file.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Current probe' listbox</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Allows the user to select the appropriate probe from the drop-down list.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span class="Button">'Edit'</span> button</p>
<p class="parameterdescription">Opens a window allowing different probe modifications.</p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Edit window example</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP169435494" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../images/plat_adv_4.jpg" width="606px" height="390px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note:</b></span> For full description of the window, please refer to the help file for FaroArmUSB.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">Stress stop section</p>
<p>If enabled lets you define the sensitivity of the stress stops</p>
<h2 class="whs4">Adjoining Information Section in Localiser tab</h2>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP169975218" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../images/plat_adv_5.jpg" width="533px" height="170px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle">'Summary of the Platinum advanced settings'</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span>Displays certification date, calibration date, current temperature, probe name, arm accuracy and description of the last occurred error (if any).</span></p>

